    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75082" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρῐκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>akin to definition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				102a9
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. στάσις</span>”
				<i>turning on a definition,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Stat.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inv.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21
			</span></i> Arg.<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.297
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.426
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Stat.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				9.71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>belonging to a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅριον,</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				143.15
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					268.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
